  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1416333,
    "UIName": "Cobra Bomber VTOL",
    "Id": "vehicledef_Cobra_Bomber",
    "Name": "Cobra Bomber VTOL",
    "Details": "The original Cobra transport VTOL was introduced by the Star League Defense Force in 2582 to assist the SLDF during the Reunification War and upgraded variants have seen constant action since that conflict. During the Succession Wars, the Cobra fell out of production, but the Word of Blake restarted the manufacturing line following their liberation of Terra in 3058. The Cobra is a rear-echelon combat vehicle that was designed for support missions. It carries a scant three tons of armor, though it can maintain speeds up to 129 km/h.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100     15\n<b>Left</b>         100     15\n<b>Right</b>       100     15\n<b>Rear</b>         85     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      400     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00>Can Resupply/Repair</color>",
    "Icon": "Anhur"
  },
